WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:54.730
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:55.000 --> 00:58.000
"Not Yours"

3
00:58.100 --> 01:00.800
(Episode 6)

4
01:09.920 --> 01:10.920
You guys are here.

5
01:12.120 --> 01:13.120
Say hello to him.

6
01:13.640 --> 01:15.199
Hello, Milan.

7
01:15.200 --> 01:16.480
Hey there!

8
01:18.159 --> 01:19.239
You're here too.

9
01:20.079 --> 01:21.079
Yeah.

10
01:22.599 --> 01:23.799
I'm here to protect these two.

11
01:25.439 --> 01:26.359
Are you guys happy today?

12
01:26.400 --> 01:27.400
Yeah.

13
01:27.680 --> 01:28.599
It's really crowded today.

14
01:28.600 --> 01:29.798
Stay close to us.

15
01:29.799 --> 01:30.239
Okay?

16
01:30.439 --> 01:31.439
Okay.

17
01:31.879 --> 01:32.879
Good kids.

18
01:32.959 --> 01:33.599
Yeah.

19
01:33.600 --> 01:35.559
Didn't someone say he'd come with us?

20
01:35.560 --> 01:36.560
Where is he?

21
01:36.760 --> 01:38.256
I knew we couldn't count on him when it matters.

22
01:38.280 --> 01:40.440
Master P'Eng had some urgent business to take care of.

23
01:40.519 --> 01:42.239
So he might be a little late.

24
01:42.959 --> 01:44.079
Can't count on who for what?

25
01:46.760 --> 01:47.760
Nothing.

26
01:47.959 --> 01:48.959
Boss P'Eng is here.

27
01:50.599 --> 01:51.640
You heard wrong.

28
01:52.480 --> 01:54.055
It's because we can count on you

29
01:54.079 --> 01:55.839
that they got to come to the amusement park.

30
01:56.817 --> 01:58.055
Hi, P'Eng.

31
01:58.079 --> 01:59.079
Hey.

32
01:59.159 --> 02:00.279
Thank you, P'Eng.

33
02:00.280 --> 02:00.799
Don't mention it.

34
02:00.959 --> 02:02.040
Such a show-off.

35
02:02.120 --> 02:03.560
Only knows how to win over kids.

36
02:04.040 --> 02:05.040
Hey.

37
02:05.799 --> 02:07.519
This is a paradise for kids.

38
02:07.760 --> 02:09.280
Of course you want to make them happy.

39
02:10.520 --> 02:11.640
Why don't you give it a try?

40
02:12.680 --> 02:14.080
I could never act like him.

41
02:16.159 --> 02:16.599
A Pong.

42
02:17.159 --> 02:18.159
Don't worry.

43
02:18.280 --> 02:20.560
He's genuinely trying to make things right with everyone.

44
02:23.599 --> 02:24.599
Mr. Milan.

45
02:24.680 --> 02:25.599
It's almost time.

46
02:25.600 --> 02:27.496
The crew says you can get changed whenever you're ready.

47
02:27.520 --> 02:27.960
Okay.

48
02:28.159 --> 02:29.359
Tell them I'll be right there.

49
02:29.919 --> 02:30.680
So, Pao Bei,

50
02:30.800 --> 02:31.439
and Boss P'Eng.

51
02:31.961 --> 02:33.575
Why don't you take Xiaotong and Xiaoya to go play first?

52
02:33.599 --> 02:34.800
We'll meet up once I'm done.

53
02:35.159 --> 02:35.560
Yeah.

54
02:35.719 --> 02:36.719
Sounds good.

55
02:37.000 --> 02:38.119
I'll leave Mingkun here with you.

56
02:38.120 --> 02:38.560
Okay.

57
02:38.879 --> 02:39.960
Hey, what about me?

58
02:41.400 --> 02:42.439
Come with us!

59
02:42.520 --> 02:43.520
No way.

60
02:44.360 --> 02:45.360
Then stick with me.

61
02:46.280 --> 02:47.479
Don't forget our deal.

62
02:48.400 --> 02:49.855
These are my leftover lottery tickets.

63
02:49.879 --> 02:51.319
If there's a winning ticket in here,

64
02:51.680 --> 02:52.680
I'll be your assistant.

65
02:53.159 --> 02:54.159
What do you say?

66
02:54.319 --> 02:55.319
Care to make a bet?

67
02:57.039 --> 02:57.400
Bring it on.

68
02:57.400 --> 02:57.800
Did you just hit me?

69
02:57.800 --> 02:58.800
All right.

70
02:58.919 --> 02:59.439
Off you go.

71
02:59.759 --> 03:00.280
Let's go.

72
03:00.759 --> 03:01.280
Go have fun.

73
03:01.319 --> 03:02.319
Yeah.

74
03:02.479 --> 03:03.479
Let's go.

75
03:04.080 --> 03:05.080
See you guys later.

76
03:30.319 --> 03:32.400
Look, this fish has stripes just like a zebra.

77
03:41.520 --> 03:42.919
The color is so pretty.

78
03:48.199 --> 03:49.199
Come here, Xiaoya.

79
03:49.240 --> 03:50.920
I'll show you how to feed the sea turtles.

80
03:59.960 --> 04:00.560
Come here.

81
04:00.560 --> 04:01.560
Take a little break.

82
04:02.800 --> 04:03.840
Are you having fun today?

83
04:04.280 --> 04:04.800
You must be thirsty.

84
04:05.039 --> 04:06.039
Have some water.

85
04:06.800 --> 04:08.080
Thank you, P'Eng.

86
04:10.520 --> 04:12.639
Do you like the jellyfish or Mr. Turtle better?

87
04:12.759 --> 04:13.840
I like them both!

88
04:18.279 --> 04:19.279
Slow down, Xiaoya.

89
04:23.759 --> 04:25.000
So many bubbles!

90
04:25.639 --> 04:27.199
The merry-go-round!

91
04:50.600 --> 04:51.960
Are you scared of the pirate ship?

92
04:53.439 --> 04:54.480
Of course not!

93
05:00.560 --> 05:02.120
I'm too scared to look!

94
05:08.079 --> 05:09.639
It feels like we're flying!

95
05:37.279 --> 05:38.480
Be careful, everyone.

96
05:39.480 --> 05:40.559
We can take photos together,

97
05:40.560 --> 05:42.055
but please line up in an orderly fashion.

98
05:42.079 --> 05:42.720
Can we take a picture?

99
05:42.720 --> 05:43.720
Is that okay?

100
05:43.759 --> 05:44.958
Alright alright alright.

101
05:44.959 --> 05:45.839
Here, hand it to me.

102
05:45.840 --> 05:46.920
One by one.

103
05:54.120 --> 05:55.359
Thank you.

104
05:55.360 --> 05:56.199
Smile!

105
05:56.199 --> 05:57.199
Say cheese!

106
05:59.120 --> 05:59.759
Come on.

107
05:59.839 --> 06:01.055
Let's do one more from another angle.

108
06:01.079 --> 06:02.160
Look happy!

109
06:09.680 --> 06:10.839
Thank you.

110
06:16.639 --> 06:17.639
Keep it up!

111
06:17.759 --> 06:18.759
Thanks.

112
06:19.000 --> 06:20.638
Big smile!

113
06:20.639 --> 06:22.318
Milan!

114
06:22.319 --> 06:24.120
You set the stage on fire!

115
06:28.040 --> 06:28.759
Watch your step.

116
06:28.759 --> 06:29.519
Please keep your distance.

117
06:29.519 --> 06:30.439
Everyone, please be careful.

118
06:30.439 --> 06:31.160
Be careful.

119
06:31.160 --> 06:32.160
Keep your distance.

120
06:32.680 --> 06:33.680
At your three o'clock.

121
06:33.800 --> 06:34.800
Follow me.

122
06:34.839 --> 06:35.959
Be careful and stay close.

123
06:36.600 --> 06:37.639
Watch your step.

124
06:38.759 --> 06:40.199
Coming through!

125
06:43.319 --> 06:44.679
Hello, everyone!

126
06:44.680 --> 06:47.919
Right behind me is the most popular attraction in Tailan,

127
06:47.920 --> 06:48.800
the Giant Pendulum!

128
06:48.920 --> 06:50.559
Now, since I'm afraid of heights,

129
06:50.560 --> 06:53.318
I'm going to pass on riding it today.

130
06:53.319 --> 06:55.920
If this video hits a million likes,

131
06:56.079 --> 06:57.119
then next time,

132
06:57.120 --> 06:59.959
I'll make a video taking on the Giant Pendulum!

133
07:00.600 --> 07:01.079
How is it?

134
07:01.199 --> 07:02.079
Does it look good here?

135
07:02.199 --> 07:03.199
It's fine.

136
07:03.279 --> 07:04.599
After showing you guys around so much,

137
07:04.600 --> 07:05.399
I'm getting thirsty

138
07:05.399 --> 07:06.079
and pretty tired.

139
07:06.399 --> 07:08.360
So now I'm going to go grab a bite to eat.

140
07:08.839 --> 07:10.519
This is my assistant, A Pong.

141
07:12.199 --> 07:13.199
And so...

142
07:14.000 --> 07:14.399
Watch out!

143
07:14.399 --> 07:15.399
I'm so sorry.

144
07:16.199 --> 07:17.199
Are you okay?

145
07:20.279 --> 07:21.279
I'm fine.

146
07:22.240 --> 07:23.240
Really?

147
07:23.319 --> 07:24.319
It's nothing.

148
07:25.639 --> 07:26.639
Mr. Milan.

149
07:27.040 --> 07:27.879
The lounge is over that way.

150
07:27.879 --> 07:28.639
Please follow me.

151
07:28.800 --> 07:29.439
Okay.

152
07:29.680 --> 07:30.680
Let's go.

153
07:33.480 --> 07:34.480
Mr. Milan.

154
07:36.279 --> 07:38.079
Do you need us to send more security?

155
07:40.360 --> 07:41.360
Not for now.

156
07:41.399 --> 07:42.439
He handled it really well.

157
07:49.000 --> 07:50.680
Could I get a quick touch-up on my makeup?

158
07:50.736 --> 07:52.096
We just need to shoot one section of footage and we're good.

159
07:52.120 --> 07:53.120
Got it.

160
07:56.399 --> 07:57.600
Take a few more shots for me.

161
07:58.399 --> 07:59.719
What else am I supposed to shoot?

162
07:59.720 --> 08:01.240
Just shoot it however you want.

163
08:01.720 --> 08:03.079
Aw, so cute!

164
08:03.759 --> 08:04.759
Fine.

165
08:06.720 --> 08:07.720
Hey.

166
08:08.319 --> 08:09.120
Oh, it's you.

167
08:09.120 --> 08:09.720
Yeah.

168
08:10.079 --> 08:11.119
How did my shots turn out?

169
08:11.439 --> 08:11.959
They're...

170
08:11.960 --> 08:13.240
They're not bad.

171
08:14.079 --> 08:15.398
Looking sharp!

172
08:15.399 --> 08:16.199
Did you get it?

173
08:16.240 --> 08:16.920
Does it look good?

174
08:17.199 --> 08:18.000
It looks great.

175
08:18.000 --> 08:18.639
Take a look.

176
08:18.839 --> 08:19.839
See?

177
08:24.560 --> 08:25.839
Aren't you leaving yet?

178
08:26.040 --> 08:27.639
A huge crowd is heading this way soon.

179
08:27.759 --> 08:29.039
If you don't leave now, you won't be able to get out.

180
08:29.040 --> 08:30.120
Just giving you a heads-up.

181
08:30.680 --> 08:31.680
It's fine.

182
08:32.279 --> 08:33.519
I've got someone protecting me.

183
08:34.440 --> 08:35.879
You actually know him?

184
08:36.120 --> 08:37.398
When he told me last time,

185
08:37.399 --> 08:38.679
I thought he was kidding.

186
08:39.360 --> 08:40.918
You even know my fans.

187
08:40.919 --> 08:41.919
Yeah.

188
08:42.080 --> 08:43.240
You're pretty well-connected.

189
08:43.960 --> 08:45.080
I told you.

190
08:45.440 --> 08:47.615
She's the one who asked me to deliver those flowers last time.

191
08:47.639 --> 08:48.719
See? I wasn't lying to you.

192
08:50.080 --> 08:51.200
That was me.

193
08:52.639 --> 08:53.816
Looks like people are coming from over there.

194
08:53.840 --> 08:55.000
Shouldn't you guys get going?

195
08:55.720 --> 08:56.440
Hold them back for a second.

196
08:56.441 --> 08:57.521
I'll be fine with just him.

197
08:57.600 --> 08:58.320
Milan!

198
08:58.320 --> 08:59.320
Bye!

199
09:01.279 --> 09:02.279
Stay back!

200
09:02.320 --> 09:03.080
You can't go through!

201
09:03.080 --> 09:03.799
Everyone, please calm down!

202
09:03.799 --> 09:04.799
Please stay back!

203
09:06.960 --> 09:07.960
Don't go over there.

204
09:10.120 --> 09:11.120
Milan!

205
09:17.759 --> 09:18.919
I think we shook them off.

206
09:21.799 --> 09:23.159
Aren't you an athlete?

207
09:23.279 --> 09:25.359
Why are you so out of breath after just a short run?

208
09:26.200 --> 09:27.200
Come on, man.

209
09:27.600 --> 09:29.759
Do you know how many years ago that was?

210
09:29.960 --> 09:30.679
Besides,

211
09:30.960 --> 09:32.919
this bag of yours weighs a ton.

212
09:33.440 --> 09:35.080
Why don't you try carrying it yourself?

213
09:35.559 --> 09:37.319
You look pretty strong, so I figured

214
09:37.320 --> 09:38.535
this little bit of weight was nothing to you.

215
09:38.559 --> 09:39.159
Give it to me.

216
09:39.200 --> 09:40.200
I'll carry it myself.

217
09:42.919 --> 09:44.199
Didn't you say it's super heavy?

218
09:44.559 --> 09:46.079
I can't have you wearing yourself out.

219
09:46.240 --> 09:47.839
You're not my assistant.

220
09:47.840 --> 09:49.480
You're my old...

221
09:49.960 --> 09:50.960
classmate, after all.

222
09:51.320 --> 09:52.320
Right?

223
09:53.799 --> 09:55.000
Alright, cut the crap.

224
09:55.080 --> 09:55.799
What do you want to ride?

225
09:55.799 --> 09:56.799
Hurry up.

226
09:56.840 --> 09:57.840
Don't waste time.

227
10:00.360 --> 10:01.200
What do you want to do?

228
10:01.360 --> 10:02.360
I'll go with you.

229
10:03.519 --> 10:05.495
If anything, I should be going along with what you want.

230
10:05.519 --> 10:07.239
I'm only here thanks to you.

231
10:07.240 --> 10:07.879
No,

232
10:07.880 --> 10:09.320
it's not thanks to me.

233
10:09.799 --> 10:12.278
It's thanks to Boss P'Eng, the guy you hate.

234
10:12.279 --> 10:14.079
I'm not the one who got you guys these spots.

235
10:16.879 --> 10:17.360
How about this?

236
10:17.679 --> 10:18.679
Rock, paper, scissors.

237
10:19.039 --> 10:19.960
Winner decides.

238
10:19.960 --> 10:20.960
No.

239
10:22.080 --> 10:23.080
Let's say it together.

240
10:23.200 --> 10:25.159
What if we want to go on the same ride?

241
10:25.480 --> 10:26.879
No way.

242
10:27.120 --> 10:28.120
Why not?

243
10:28.240 --> 10:28.879
Did you forget?

244
10:29.159 --> 10:30.279
Back when we were in school,

245
10:30.519 --> 10:32.719
we used to get the exact same test scores all the time.

246
10:33.960 --> 10:36.879
That's just because both of our grades were equally terrible.

247
10:37.120 --> 10:38.320
Come on, just say it.

248
10:38.360 --> 10:38.960
I'll count down from three.

249
10:38.960 --> 10:39.960
We'll say it together.

250
10:40.840 --> 10:41.320
Three,

251
10:41.759 --> 10:42.240
two,

252
10:42.279 --> 10:42.759
one.

253
10:42.759 --> 10:43.759
- Roller coaster!

254
10:51.600 --> 10:52.678
See?

255
10:52.679 --> 10:54.439
I told you we were on the same wavelength.

256
10:54.440 --> 10:55.480
Totally in sync.

257
10:57.559 --> 10:59.000
Why are you so touchy-feely?

258
10:59.399 --> 11:01.959
Do you have any idea how many fans would kill to hug me?

259
11:01.960 --> 11:03.440
And here you are complaining.

260
11:05.240 --> 11:06.879
I'm not one of your fans.

261
11:10.039 --> 11:11.039
Don't forget

262
11:11.120 --> 11:12.359
who said back then

263
11:12.360 --> 11:14.240
that he'd be my very first fan once I debuted?

264
11:16.073 --> 11:17.073
Hmmm?

265
11:18.320 --> 11:18.919
That...

266
11:18.920 --> 11:20.120
That was so many years ago.

267
11:21.360 --> 11:22.639
How do you still remember that?

268
11:33.840 --> 11:35.000
Thanks for today.

269
11:35.759 --> 11:36.840
So, how was today?

270
11:37.879 --> 11:38.879
How was what?

271
11:40.200 --> 11:41.399
I mean, how did I do today?

272
11:41.720 --> 11:42.720
Did your brother

273
11:42.721 --> 11:45.480
have any feedback or anything?

274
11:47.960 --> 11:50.159
Wait till they get back with the ice cream,

275
11:50.320 --> 11:51.320
and ask him yourself.

276
11:59.320 --> 12:00.639
That's really pretty.

277
12:00.679 --> 12:01.799
And so tall.

278
12:02.200 --> 12:03.440
I'd love to take a ride.

279
12:06.399 --> 12:08.840
Look, I know I'm tall,

280
12:08.919 --> 12:09.959
but calling me "pretty"...

281
12:09.960 --> 12:11.200
isn't that going a bit too far?

282
12:11.960 --> 12:12.960
I mean,

283
12:13.080 --> 12:15.080
at least use "dashingly handsome" to describe me.

284
12:15.639 --> 12:16.639
And besides...

285
12:17.519 --> 12:18.519
Take...

286
12:18.840 --> 12:19.840
take a ride?

287
12:20.240 --> 12:21.878
I only took you guys out once,

288
12:21.879 --> 12:24.480
and you're already throwing yourself at me?

289
12:26.440 --> 12:27.639
Boss P'Eng,

290
12:28.120 --> 12:31.080
I was talking about the Ferris wheel right behind you.

291
12:35.320 --> 12:37.800
I really want to go up there and see what Mancheng looks like.

292
12:48.679 --> 12:49.480
Let me take Xiaoya.

293
12:49.480 --> 12:50.000
P'Eng,

294
12:50.001 --> 12:51.081
carrying her is too tiring.

295
12:51.679 --> 12:52.159
It's fine.

296
12:52.279 --> 12:53.000
She's not heavy.

297
12:53.001 --> 12:54.321
The kid's probably just worn out.

298
12:55.559 --> 12:57.559
Looks like the Ferris wheel is closed for the day.

299
12:57.600 --> 12:58.680
I just went over and asked.

300
12:58.919 --> 13:00.976
They have a minor issue and need to do some maintenance.

301
13:01.000 --> 13:02.720
We probably won't be able to ride it today.

302
13:03.600 --> 13:04.600
What?

303
13:05.039 --> 13:06.558
It's fine every other day,

304
13:06.559 --> 13:08.519
why does it have to break down today of all days?

305
13:08.600 --> 13:09.855
What's so fun about that anyway?

306
13:09.879 --> 13:11.495
I'll take you to see the fireworks show later.

307
13:11.519 --> 13:12.440
P'Eng,

308
13:12.441 --> 13:13.879
what's a fireworks show?

309
13:16.440 --> 13:17.440
How do I put it?

310
13:17.720 --> 13:19.039
It's when they shoot fireworks

311
13:20.480 --> 13:22.878
up into the sky, and it's super pretty.

312
13:22.879 --> 13:24.840
It goes "boom" like this,

313
13:25.879 --> 13:27.079
with tons of colors,

314
13:27.080 --> 13:29.999
and it looks like stars falling from the sky.

315
13:30.000 --> 13:31.000
Oh!

316
13:32.080 --> 13:33.080
Okay.

317
13:33.960 --> 13:35.255
Anyway, you'll see for yourself in a bit.

318
13:35.279 --> 13:35.720
Okay.

319
13:35.919 --> 13:38.038
Master, today's fireworks show...

320
13:38.039 --> 13:39.320
seems to be canceled too.

321
13:41.000 --> 13:43.399
Aw, what a shame.

322
13:54.360 --> 13:56.560
Why do I feel like the universe is out to get me again?

323
13:58.159 --> 14:00.199
Maybe fate just doesn't want to give me the chance.

324
14:00.799 --> 14:01.840
Chance for what?

325
14:02.240 --> 14:03.240
You know,

326
14:03.759 --> 14:05.959
the chance to see the beautiful night view of Mancheng.

327
14:06.919 --> 14:08.960
Maybe if I get a taste of something good once,

328
14:09.279 --> 14:10.879
I'll just want to hold onto it forever.

329
14:11.519 --> 14:14.080
It's honestly better to never have it at all.

330
14:15.120 --> 14:16.240
It's fine this way.

331
14:20.919 --> 14:21.919
Come on, get up.

332
14:22.679 --> 14:23.879
I'm taking you guys somewhere.

333
14:26.000 --> 14:27.000
Where?

334
14:33.399 --> 14:34.159
Master,

335
14:34.399 --> 14:36.360
little Xiaoya looks completely exhausted.

336
14:36.759 --> 14:38.519
I'll take her back to the car to rest first.

337
14:41.159 --> 14:42.159
Let's go.

338
15:52.759 --> 15:53.959
Milan!

339
15:53.960 --> 15:55.840
Milan, can I get a picture with you?

340
15:57.120 --> 15:58.240
It's Milan!

341
15:59.159 --> 16:00.279
Everyone, please be careful!

342
16:01.279 --> 16:02.759
Milan!

343
16:02.960 --> 16:03.600
Excuse me.

344
16:03.600 --> 16:04.320
Milan!

345
16:04.320 --> 16:05.320
Don't go!

346
16:20.320 --> 16:21.839
Jeez, where did you run off to?

347
16:21.840 --> 16:22.759
I looked everywhere for you.

348
16:22.760 --> 16:23.959
I figured I'd disappear for once

349
16:23.960 --> 16:25.840
so you'd know how it feels.

350
16:26.960 --> 16:27.999
Man, I was chased the whole way here.

351
16:28.000 --> 16:28.519
Hurry, let's go.

352
16:29.000 --> 16:30.000
Come with me.

353
16:51.919 --> 16:53.039
It's gorgeous.

354
16:53.320 --> 16:54.639
The night view here is amazing.

355
16:55.519 --> 16:56.519
I wanna see too!

356
16:56.520 --> 16:58.039
Bro, give me a piggyback ride, quick!

357
17:06.480 --> 17:07.680
What's wrong with you?

358
17:07.880 --> 17:09.118
You look a little pale.

359
17:09.119 --> 17:10.119
I...

360
17:11.799 --> 17:12.919
I'm a bit afraid of heights.

361
17:14.519 --> 17:15.599
Afraid of heights?

362
17:15.960 --> 17:17.456
And you still dared to ride the pirate ship?

363
17:17.480 --> 17:18.000
Yeah.

364
17:18.319 --> 17:19.319
Now you know

365
17:20.400 --> 17:21.559
how much I sacrificed.

366
17:24.440 --> 17:25.960
Come here, I'll lift you up.

367
17:26.359 --> 17:28.680
P'Eng is a scaredy-cat who's afraid of heights!

368
17:28.880 --> 17:29.880
Hold on.

369
17:30.640 --> 17:33.575
Acrophobia is a natural physical reaction. It has nothing to do with being a scaredy-cat.

370
17:33.599 --> 17:34.599
I am not a coward.

371
17:34.799 --> 17:35.799
Come here.

372
17:35.960 --> 17:36.960
Get on my back.

373
17:37.319 --> 17:38.319
You'll be even higher up.

374
17:38.480 --> 17:39.480
Okay!

375
17:39.680 --> 17:40.839
One, two, three.

376
17:42.519 --> 17:43.759
Are you sure you're okay?

377
17:44.039 --> 17:45.240
Don't drop my brother.

378
17:45.440 --> 17:46.440
Don't underestimate me.

379
17:46.440 --> 17:47.440
There we go.

380
17:49.640 --> 17:52.119
The night view is so pretty, bro!

381
18:03.519 --> 18:04.798
It's really gorgeous!

382
18:04.799 --> 18:06.278
P'Eng,

383
18:06.279 --> 18:07.959
maybe you should put me down.

384
18:07.960 --> 18:08.960
Okay.

385
18:12.599 --> 18:14.399
I'll go get Mingkun and Xiaoya

386
18:14.400 --> 18:15.760
so we can watch the view together.

387
18:15.799 --> 18:16.799
Okay.

388
18:16.920 --> 18:17.920
Yeah.

389
18:23.880 --> 18:24.559
Um...

390
18:24.799 --> 18:26.000
Why is your face so red?

391
18:26.400 --> 18:28.080
Why don't we go rest over there for a bit?

392
18:28.559 --> 18:29.559
Sure.

393
18:37.279 --> 18:38.480
I'm feeling a bit better now.

394
18:38.960 --> 18:40.880
I think I'm getting used to it.

395
18:47.240 --> 18:48.759
It's so beautiful here.

396
18:49.359 --> 18:51.079
It's my first time seeing a view like this.

397
18:55.359 --> 18:56.959
So it's because you're afraid of heights

398
18:57.680 --> 18:59.358
that you were so nervous on the pirate ship, right?

399
18:59.359 --> 19:00.000
Yeah.

400
19:00.000 --> 19:01.000
What did you think?

401
19:01.160 --> 19:02.920
Fear of heights is a biological response.

402
19:03.039 --> 19:04.480
You can't control it, you know?

403
19:09.160 --> 19:10.798
And here I thought our Boss P'Eng

404
19:10.799 --> 19:12.440
was completely fearless.

405
19:14.400 --> 19:16.040
Turns out you're scared of something too.

406
19:17.559 --> 19:19.519
I think you're the one who's completely fearless.

407
19:23.200 --> 19:25.278
Actually, there are plenty of things

408
19:25.279 --> 19:26.799
that scare me too.

409
19:28.119 --> 19:29.200
Like what?

410
19:39.400 --> 19:40.440
Like...

411
19:41.200 --> 19:42.800
My biggest fear is running out of money.

412
19:43.119 --> 19:44.416
What's so scary about having no money?

413
19:44.440 --> 19:45.440
Just make more.

414
19:45.559 --> 19:46.720
You're perfectly capable.

415
19:49.480 --> 19:51.200
A rich boy like you wouldn't understand.

416
19:52.400 --> 19:53.480
Still, today,

417
19:53.920 --> 19:56.240
thank you for making Xiaotong and Xiaoya's wish come true.

418
19:59.960 --> 20:01.480
Thank you from the bottom of my heart.

419
20:14.640 --> 20:15.799
Their wish came true.

420
20:17.279 --> 20:18.279
What about yours?

421
20:19.359 --> 20:20.440
What's your wish?

422
20:35.759 --> 20:37.200
Xiaotong and Xiaoya...

423
20:41.000 --> 20:42.559
Their wish

424
20:42.880 --> 20:44.599
is my wish.

425
20:56.880 --> 20:57.880
Hello?

426
20:58.559 --> 20:59.559
Yeah.

427
20:59.680 --> 21:00.680
You can start now.

428
21:02.480 --> 21:03.920
Am I keeping you from your work?

429
21:04.440 --> 21:05.440
Should we head back?

430
21:05.759 --> 21:06.759
It's fine.

431
21:07.440 --> 21:09.440
Tell me what your wish is first.

432
21:11.960 --> 21:12.960
My wish?

433
21:15.000 --> 21:16.000
What do you mean?

434
21:16.200 --> 21:17.880
Before my mom passed away, she used to say

435
21:19.039 --> 21:20.359
that when fireworks are blooming,

436
21:20.720 --> 21:21.839
the wishes you make

437
21:22.920 --> 21:24.240
are the most likely to come true.

438
21:26.079 --> 21:27.119
Really?

439
21:27.359 --> 21:29.200
That's the first time I've heard of that.

440
21:29.359 --> 21:30.079
It's true.

441
21:30.359 --> 21:32.359
All the wishes I made before ended up coming true.

442
21:41.880 --> 21:44.480
But there aren't any fireworks right now.

443
21:46.960 --> 21:47.960
Close your eyes.

444
21:48.880 --> 21:49.240
Huh?

445
21:49.480 --> 21:50.480
Just close your eyes.

446
22:02.000 --> 22:03.000
Three,

447
22:03.480 --> 22:04.480
two,

448
22:05.319 --> 22:05.839
one.

449
22:06.319 --> 22:07.319
Open them.

450
22:12.759 --> 22:14.240
Quick, make a wish now!

451
22:15.799 --> 22:18.279
I wish for Xiaotong and Xiaoya to always be healthy and happy.

452
22:19.200 --> 22:21.000
I wish for Mom to come back soon,

453
22:21.400 --> 22:23.079
so we can live a peaceful, stable life.

454
22:24.160 --> 22:25.240
And I wish...

455
22:26.720 --> 22:29.119
Wait, how many wishes do I get?

456
22:29.960 --> 22:31.200
Can I have three?

457
22:35.759 --> 22:37.160
Hey, I'm talking to you!

458
22:38.319 --> 22:39.480
Did you hear me?

459
22:41.359 --> 22:42.359
Where did you go?

460
24:02.640 --> 24:03.720
Here you go, Boss P'Eng.

461
24:14.160 --> 24:15.160
Thanks.

462
24:17.079 --> 24:18.239
Looks pretty good.

463
24:18.240 --> 24:19.279
Yeah.

464
24:22.400 --> 24:24.879
I heard you guys got mobbed by fans today.

465
24:24.880 --> 24:25.880
Are you okay?

466
24:27.480 --> 24:28.680
Thankfully, A Pong was there.

467
24:29.160 --> 24:31.200
Otherwise, I might've really been trapped in there.

468
24:31.599 --> 24:33.319
He's the person you were looking for?

469
24:34.400 --> 24:36.118
You two were really college classmates?

470
24:36.119 --> 24:37.119
Yeah.

471
24:37.920 --> 24:39.160
We even sat next to each other.

472
24:39.720 --> 24:40.760
What a coincidence, right?

473
24:42.119 --> 24:44.599
Though we really owe this reunion to you, Boss P'Eng.

474
24:45.400 --> 24:47.840
Otherwise, it might've taken us forever to cross paths again.

475
24:55.799 --> 24:58.960
Who knows if that's a blessing or a curse.

476
24:59.839 --> 25:02.599
Every twist of fate is a blessing.

477
25:02.880 --> 25:04.439
There's no such thing as a curse.

478
25:04.440 --> 25:08.000
After all, isn't that how you and Pao Bei met?

479
25:18.400 --> 25:19.279
P'Eng.

480
25:19.279 --> 25:19.759
Yeah?

481
25:19.760 --> 25:21.558
Can I trade this rose for a bottle of water?

482
25:21.559 --> 25:23.078
My sister says she's a little thirsty.

483
25:23.079 --> 25:24.838
Of course you can.

484
25:24.839 --> 25:25.839
Here.

485
25:26.440 --> 25:27.519
Some water,

486
25:29.319 --> 25:30.319
and two barbecue skewers.

487
25:31.079 --> 25:32.079
Enjoy.

488
25:32.440 --> 25:33.599
Thank you, P'Eng!

489
25:33.640 --> 25:34.640
Off you go.

490
25:35.799 --> 25:37.519
Looks like you guys had a great time today.

491
25:40.759 --> 25:41.759
By the way,

492
25:42.920 --> 25:45.360
about finding me an assistant like you mentioned last time...

493
25:45.920 --> 25:47.118
What do you think of A Pong?

494
25:47.119 --> 25:48.920
If you want to hire him, go ahead.

495
25:49.839 --> 25:51.720
Though I should warn you,

496
25:52.799 --> 25:53.799
with that temper of his,

497
25:54.400 --> 25:55.760
isn't he a bit too much to handle?

498
25:59.319 --> 26:00.480
Well,

499
26:01.000 --> 26:02.599
everything has its pros and cons.

500
26:02.960 --> 26:04.696
Sometimes, when artists like us play the good cop,

501
26:04.720 --> 26:06.680
we need our assistants to play the bad cop.

502
26:06.920 --> 26:07.920
Hmm.

503
26:08.680 --> 26:09.480
That's true.

504
26:09.599 --> 26:10.599
You're too nice.

505
26:10.720 --> 26:12.136
People can easily walk all over you.

506
26:12.160 --> 26:13.480
Having someone to back you up

507
26:14.119 --> 26:15.119
is actually a good thing.

508
26:16.839 --> 26:19.240
Actually, A Pong doesn't really have a bad temper.

509
26:20.279 --> 26:21.798
He probably just cares too much about his friends.

510
26:21.799 --> 26:24.960
So, Boss P'Eng,

511
26:25.400 --> 26:26.720
please don't hold it against him.

512
26:27.759 --> 26:29.119
Me?

513
26:29.759 --> 26:31.000
I don't mind.

514
26:31.799 --> 26:34.839
Honestly, I actually envy Pao Bei sometimes,

515
26:35.119 --> 26:37.480
having a buddy who'd risk his life for him.

516
26:37.839 --> 26:39.039
Someone like me

517
26:41.200 --> 26:42.518
doesn't really have any friends.

518
26:42.519 --> 26:44.839
How can anyone go through life without friends?

519
26:45.039 --> 26:46.119
Because when I was a kid,

520
26:46.920 --> 26:49.558
my father only cared about me studying hard,

521
26:49.559 --> 26:51.639
saying the company would depend on me in the future.

522
26:51.960 --> 26:53.840
He even controlled who I could be friends with.

523
26:54.279 --> 26:55.279
Besides,

524
26:57.599 --> 26:59.160
I don't like making friends anyway.

525
26:59.599 --> 27:01.440
Even though we're business partners,

526
27:01.559 --> 27:03.319
if you ever need a friend,

527
27:03.640 --> 27:04.880
we can be your friends.

528
27:07.480 --> 27:10.318
Honestly, once you get to know A Pong,

529
27:10.319 --> 27:12.119
you'll see he's a pretty straightforward guy.

530
27:16.480 --> 27:17.519
I can tell.

531
27:18.079 --> 27:20.519
Compared to those slick corporate types,

532
27:21.119 --> 27:24.598
I'd probably much rather hang out with him.

533
27:24.599 --> 27:25.640
You're right.

534
27:26.599 --> 27:28.559
That's why I've been wanting to hire him.

535
27:29.279 --> 27:31.920
And it just so happens he got fired from his chef job.

536
27:32.640 --> 27:34.320
It seems to have something to do with you.

537
27:34.720 --> 27:35.919
As for that,

538
27:35.920 --> 27:37.199
I'll get to the bottom of it.

539
27:37.200 --> 27:38.200
Alright.

540
27:38.680 --> 27:39.920
Then about this job,

541
27:40.119 --> 27:41.399
I'll ask him what he thinks, too.

542
27:41.400 --> 27:42.400
Okay.

543
27:42.440 --> 27:44.199
Still, having your approval

544
27:44.200 --> 27:45.519
makes me really happy.

545
27:46.599 --> 27:47.640
Come on.

546
27:48.000 --> 27:49.039
Cheers to you.

547
27:59.640 --> 28:00.640
Master P'Eng,

548
28:00.839 --> 28:03.480
Mr. Pao Bei and Mr. A Pong have finished preparing dinner.

549
28:03.799 --> 28:04.720
Should we serve it now?

550
28:04.720 --> 28:05.720
Go ahead.

551
28:59.759 --> 29:00.759
Let's dance together.

552
29:07.039 --> 29:08.079
I'm so full.

553
29:08.640 --> 29:10.535
It's all your fault for making the food so delicious.

554
29:10.559 --> 29:12.599
I'm going to have to starve myself again tomorrow.

555
29:14.599 --> 29:15.240
Don't mention it.

556
29:15.241 --> 29:16.521
I'm just glad you guys liked it.

557
29:17.519 --> 29:19.118
We wanted to thank you for hosting us anyway,

558
29:19.119 --> 29:20.639
after showing us around all day today.

559
29:20.839 --> 29:22.999
You've thanked them a million times already.

560
29:23.000 --> 29:24.240
Stop making them thank us back.

561
29:27.960 --> 29:29.240
Hey, take it easy on the drinks.

562
29:30.000 --> 29:31.000
Don't drink too much.

563
29:32.519 --> 29:33.640
So what if I do?

564
29:34.440 --> 29:35.479
This place of yours is so nice.

565
29:35.480 --> 29:36.520
I'm crashing here tonight.

566
29:37.200 --> 29:39.118
Look, there's booze and flowers here.

567
29:39.119 --> 29:40.599
It's way better than my place.

568
29:42.119 --> 29:43.119
It's fine.

569
29:43.599 --> 29:44.856
He can hold his liquor pretty well.

570
29:44.880 --> 29:46.280
I've never even seen him get drunk.

571
29:48.200 --> 29:49.200
It's fine.

572
29:49.319 --> 29:50.319
If he gets drunk later,

573
29:50.320 --> 29:51.479
I'll get a room ready for him.

574
29:51.480 --> 29:52.079
Don't worry.

575
29:52.080 --> 29:53.639
Hey, Big Devil!

576
29:53.640 --> 29:54.640
Oh, no, wait.

577
29:54.680 --> 29:56.200
Our Boss P'Eng!

578
29:57.000 --> 29:58.839
Don't just drink by yourself.

579
29:59.480 --> 30:01.278
When it comes to alcohol,

580
30:01.279 --> 30:04.119
it's only fun when everyone drinks together!

581
30:04.839 --> 30:07.119
Come on, cheers to you!

582
30:10.759 --> 30:11.759
Here!

583
30:16.880 --> 30:18.319
Come on, Boss P'Eng.

584
30:18.839 --> 30:20.799
Here's a toast to you!

585
30:21.000 --> 30:22.319
Why aren't you toasting me?

586
30:22.880 --> 30:24.320
Do you look down on me or something?

587
30:25.160 --> 30:26.160
Huh?

588
30:27.079 --> 30:28.079
You...

589
30:28.319 --> 30:29.839
Who are you?

590
30:30.519 --> 30:33.519
I only toast to our most beloved Boss P'Eng!

591
30:34.160 --> 30:36.079
Right, Boss P'Eng?

592
30:36.480 --> 30:39.439
Boss P'Eng, I love you so much!

593
30:39.440 --> 30:42.399
Just like a mouse loves cheese!

594
30:42.400 --> 30:43.720
Okay.

595
30:44.079 --> 30:45.799
Drink up, Boss P'Eng!

596
30:45.960 --> 30:47.240
Drink up!

597
30:51.440 --> 30:53.839
Boss P'Eng, you're a real man!

598
30:54.039 --> 30:55.039
Downed it in one gulp!

599
30:55.200 --> 30:56.200
What a guy!

600
30:56.480 --> 30:57.839
I respect that!

601
30:59.480 --> 31:00.440
What are you doing?

602
31:00.441 --> 31:01.519
I love you, man!

603
31:02.440 --> 31:04.440
Boss P'Eng is so cool!

604
31:04.640 --> 31:06.559
He chugged the whole thing!

605
31:09.480 --> 31:11.559
Wait, why is Boss P'Eng blushing?

606
31:12.640 --> 31:14.640
A Pong, you've really had too much.

607
31:14.799 --> 31:15.799
Stop drinking.

608
31:18.119 --> 31:18.680
Mingkun.

609
31:18.680 --> 31:19.680
Look at him.

610
31:24.039 --> 31:24.559
Mingkun.

611
31:25.039 --> 31:26.775
Could you please get a guest room ready for A Pong?

612
31:26.799 --> 31:28.399
Don't worry, it's already taken care of.

613
31:29.119 --> 31:29.759
Rest assured.

614
31:30.039 --> 31:31.399
I'll take him to his room to rest.

615
31:31.720 --> 31:33.280
Your brother and sister are still here.

616
31:34.000 --> 31:35.518
No need for that extra room.

617
31:35.519 --> 31:36.639
He can stay with me tonight.

618
31:37.759 --> 31:38.919
He's awesome!

619
31:38.920 --> 31:39.920
Stop talking.

620
31:48.079 --> 31:49.039
Just get him out of here!

621
31:49.040 --> 31:50.720
You're the man, Boss P'Eng!

622
31:51.200 --> 31:52.279
I love you!

623
31:53.480 --> 31:54.839
Your friend is out of his mind.

624
31:55.039 --> 31:56.439
Just kissing people out of nowhere.

625
32:02.200 --> 32:03.399
Why are you staring at me

626
32:03.400 --> 32:04.520
with that look on your face?

627
32:06.279 --> 32:07.920
How can you even ask me that?

628
32:08.599 --> 32:09.640
What do you mean?

629
32:10.720 --> 32:13.078
Don't you go around kissing people for no reason too?

630
32:13.079 --> 32:14.079
You're one to talk.

631
32:37.279 --> 32:38.359
That's different.

632
32:40.519 --> 32:41.799
How is it different?

633
32:42.440 --> 32:43.440
It's just...

634
32:46.960 --> 32:47.960
P'Tao!

635
32:48.640 --> 32:50.798
We just dug up a bottle from the dirt!

636
32:50.799 --> 32:52.119
What is this?

637
33:07.079 --> 33:08.199
What's this drawing of?

638
33:08.200 --> 33:09.200
It's nothing.

639
33:09.279 --> 33:10.399
Just a drawing from when I was a kid.

640
33:10.400 --> 33:12.240
I don't even remember when it was buried here.

641
33:33.519 --> 33:34.680
Here we are.

642
33:34.880 --> 33:36.200
All right.

643
33:48.799 --> 33:50.319
You're a real troublemaker.

644
33:50.559 --> 33:52.240
Boss P'Eng is such a germaphobe,

645
33:52.480 --> 33:53.758
and you actually kissed him.

646
33:53.759 --> 33:54.920
You've got some nerve.

647
33:55.079 --> 33:56.079
You're so bad.

648
33:57.599 --> 34:00.440
I was just messing around because I see him as a friend.

649
34:03.519 --> 34:05.200
So you kiss people just to mess with them?

650
34:07.000 --> 34:08.518
You see me as a friend,

651
34:08.519 --> 34:09.800
and you've never kissed me.

652
34:11.880 --> 34:13.360
Haven't I?

653
34:14.119 --> 34:15.119
Nope.

654
34:20.400 --> 34:22.039
So by your logic,

655
34:22.320 --> 34:24.119
you don't consider me a friend.

656
34:28.360 --> 34:29.920
Well, do you consider me a friend?

657
34:30.039 --> 34:31.440
Only if you see me as a friend

658
34:31.719 --> 34:33.079
can I see you as one.

659
34:51.719 --> 34:53.480
Then what does it take to be your friend?

660
35:03.800 --> 35:05.400
Give me a kiss,

661
35:05.960 --> 35:07.039
and I'll tell you.

662
35:27.119 --> 35:28.719
If it's that easy to be your friend,

663
35:29.360 --> 35:30.840
that's kind of boring.

664
35:32.199 --> 35:33.440
No fun at all.

665
35:40.840 --> 35:42.239
Want a challenge?

666
35:46.320 --> 35:47.679
Come here, I'll tell you.

667
35:54.840 --> 35:56.199
Sleep with me.

668
36:38.239 --> 36:39.239
Here's your drink.

669
36:40.719 --> 36:42.400
Come have a drink.

670
36:44.800 --> 36:47.399
I can't really handle hard liquor like this.

671
36:47.400 --> 36:48.920
Didn't you say you wanted to thank me?

672
36:59.719 --> 37:01.559
How can anyone actually enjoy

673
37:02.000 --> 37:03.320
drinking this stuff?

674
37:03.760 --> 37:05.078
Tastes like medicine.

675
37:05.079 --> 37:06.760
This is top-shelf liquor.

676
37:07.280 --> 37:08.280
Sip it slowly,

677
37:08.480 --> 37:09.480
you'll get used to it.

678
37:12.480 --> 37:13.999
If I drink any more, I won't be able to leave.

679
37:14.000 --> 37:15.760
It wouldn't be your first time staying over.

680
37:16.159 --> 37:17.360
Just stay.

681
37:21.079 --> 37:22.880
I have to take the kids home later.

682
37:25.000 --> 37:26.760
It's too much trouble having them stay here.

683
37:35.840 --> 37:37.760
Let Xiaotong and Xiaoya stay here.

684
37:38.039 --> 37:39.239
There are plenty of rooms.

685
37:39.840 --> 37:40.920
You should move in too.

686
37:41.559 --> 37:43.919
I'll have the driver take them to and from school every day.

687
37:43.920 --> 37:44.920
It's very convenient.

688
37:47.119 --> 37:48.479
Are you drunk already after just that little bit?

689
37:48.480 --> 37:49.920
What nonsense are you talking about?

690
37:50.599 --> 37:52.960
How could I possibly let them live in a mansion like this?

691
37:53.159 --> 37:54.519
What's wrong with a big house?

692
37:55.039 --> 37:56.440
Isn't a big house nice?

693
37:57.119 --> 37:58.119
No, it's not.

694
37:58.719 --> 38:00.159
Once they get used to it,

695
38:01.360 --> 38:03.135
they won't be able to go back to a small place.

696
38:03.159 --> 38:05.119
I wouldn't get used to it,

697
38:06.920 --> 38:08.519
and I wouldn't be able to leave.

698
38:08.960 --> 38:10.119
Then don't leave.

699
38:21.440 --> 38:24.920
I still want to find my mom as soon as possible

700
38:25.639 --> 38:27.360
and return the ring to you.

701
38:27.679 --> 38:28.960
I don't want to owe you.

702
38:31.199 --> 38:33.800
I feel like I already owe you way too much.

703
38:34.000 --> 38:35.719
You really do need to find your mom soon.

704
38:36.760 --> 38:38.639
That ring means a great deal to me.

705
38:39.159 --> 38:40.559
If your family is short on cash,

706
38:41.440 --> 38:42.800
I can lend you some for now.

707
38:48.760 --> 38:50.400
I want to find her as soon as I can, too.

708
38:50.960 --> 38:52.880
Honestly, right now,

709
38:53.360 --> 38:54.920
I really don't have any leads.

710
38:56.079 --> 38:57.719
All I can do is ask around

711
38:58.559 --> 38:59.800
and wait for news.

712
39:00.000 --> 39:01.840
Do whatever it takes to get in touch with her.

713
39:02.119 --> 39:03.119
Just tell her

714
39:03.320 --> 39:04.840
money isn't an issue, I can handle it.

715
39:04.880 --> 39:06.200
Tell her to come back right away.

716
39:15.559 --> 39:16.559
I...

717
39:18.559 --> 39:21.440
I can't let you keep paying for my family's mistakes.

718
39:26.039 --> 39:27.199
What if...

719
39:32.840 --> 39:34.920
I'm willing to pay the price for my own feelings?

720
39:51.119 --> 39:52.400
What's going on?

721
39:53.400 --> 39:56.199
My face didn't even burn this much when he kissed me.

722
39:57.400 --> 39:59.119
How could just one sentence make me...

723
40:09.679 --> 40:10.960
This liquor

724
40:11.960 --> 40:13.440
really packs a punch.

725
40:15.880 --> 40:17.480
Since when am I such a lightweight?

726
40:17.719 --> 40:19.199
I'm so dizzy.

727
40:20.199 --> 40:21.360
There's a little bit left.

728
40:22.199 --> 40:23.199
Finish it up.

729
40:23.440 --> 40:25.360
Once you finish, I'll take you somewhere.

730
40:37.719 --> 40:38.719
Where?

731
40:40.239 --> 40:41.559
I'm taking you to a place

732
40:42.400 --> 40:44.119
you've always been curious about.
